# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF, and check them out as LF on
# every platform including Windows. Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# LF to CRLF in the working tree, which would edit the LGPL text in LICENSE
# after checkout. The license file is meant to stay byte identical to upstream
# Debugify's copy, so it must not be touched by line ending conversion.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The LGPL text and the modification notice are verbatim legal documents.
# Never let a filter, diff driver or EOL conversion alter them.
LICENSE -text
NOTICE -text

# Binary files.
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
